{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Long time no talk! I wanted to tell ya I just joined a writers group. It's unbelievable--such inspirational people who really get my writing. I'm feeling so motivated and supported, it's like I finally belong somewhere!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-c6b0ebf742fb7cc0ad92068d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.519358+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6b0ebf742fb7cc0ad92068d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6b0ebf742fb7cc0ad92068d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! That's awesome! Having a supportive group around you can really make a difference. What kind of projects are you working on with them?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-1511d70d6a04cc9840a764fe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.551606+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1511d70d6a04cc9840a764fe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1511d70d6a04cc9840a764fe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! We've made some great progress. I'm working on one with my group called \"Finding Home.\" It's a script about a girl on a journey to find her true home. I find it really rewarding and emotional. What about you? Any upcoming gaming tournaments?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-f2d939ad0f2b1f8f36c0e5b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.576399+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f2d939ad0f2b1f8f36c0e5b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f2d939ad0f2b1f8f36c0e5b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hi Joanna! \"Finding Home\" sounds really special. Must be so meaningful to work on. I've got a gaming tournament next month and I'm feeling good about it. It's gonna be my 4th one!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-3fdb1c2906e9ed039e2b3089", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.599291+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3fdb1c2906e9ed039e2b3089", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3fdb1c2906e9ed039e2b3089", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah, I bet the nerves and excitement are quite a rush! I remember when I did my first play, I was so nervous I forgot my lines. It was embarrassing, but it taught me how important it is to prepare and stay in the moment."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-227edf755a93e1b76095233f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.614981+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "227edf755a93e1b76095233f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "227edf755a93e1b76095233f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sounds like you had an interesting time on stage! It's always a learning experience. Have you ever considered going back to acting? Is that you in the photo?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-c78de77ab92626ff67ddfcdf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.640372+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c78de77ab92626ff67ddfcdf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c78de77ab92626ff67ddfcdf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah, that's me in that photo! Acting was my first passion, but now I really shine in writing. It helps me express myself in a new way, but who knows, maybe I'll go back to acting someday. Never say never!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-6353f0adabf080d798a19e88", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.663222+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6353f0adabf080d798a19e88", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6353f0adabf080d798a19e88", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Go for it! Follow your passion for writing, but if acting really makes you happy, give it a shot as well. Who knows what'll happen! Any particular movies that spark your writing?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-d83d63427721bafdb403dc0a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.682983+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d83d63427721bafdb403dc0a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d83d63427721bafdb403dc0a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! I'm gonna keep writing, but if acting calls out I might give it a try. I really enjoy dramas and emotionally-driven films. What about you? What inspires your passion?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-30e60ed6b23dc5d36dc32cfa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.696838+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "30e60ed6b23dc5d36dc32cfa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "30e60ed6b23dc5d36dc32cfa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I love fantasy and sci-fi movies, they're a great escape and get my imagination going. Playing video games is a great way to express my creativity and passion."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-8d79e35d275f5bd3c3bfcd27", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.708853+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8d79e35d275f5bd3c3bfcd27", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8d79e35d275f5bd3c3bfcd27", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's awesome! I love how video games can really spark your imagination. Do you have a favorite fantasy or sci-fi movie?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-b9b8fc7184d5ef9bb33456c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.742619+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9b8fc7184d5ef9bb33456c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9b8fc7184d5ef9bb33456c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yeah, for sure! This trilogy is one of my faves. The world building, battles, and storytelling always blow me away!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-d3b719bc5eb457bf9a9a6eef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.755958+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d3b719bc5eb457bf9a9a6eef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d3b719bc5eb457bf9a9a6eef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, that's great to hear! What books do you enjoy? I'm always up for some new book recommendations."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-0ab954f810c145d152c2f354", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.778814+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0ab954f810c145d152c2f354", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0ab954f810c145d152c2f354", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I love this series. It has adventures, magic, and great characters - it's a must-read!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-89e1a51775c98ff08590837f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.796980+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "89e1a51775c98ff08590837f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "89e1a51775c98ff08590837f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Heard of that series! It's been on my list forever. Thanks for the recommendation, Nate. I'm definitely going to check it out!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-9790cca1ff001709c5fd640d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.802489+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9790cca1ff001709c5fd640d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9790cca1ff001709c5fd640d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: No problem, glad to see an interest. Let me know what you think when you check it out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-7e7a0ee4f75c3c4744f1ee26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.834326+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7e7a0ee4f75c3c4744f1ee26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7e7a0ee4f75c3c4744f1ee26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! I'll definitely let you know my thoughts. Take care and have a great day!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-cf0f9e28d727cee7b4997a99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.853597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf0f9e28d727cee7b4997a99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf0f9e28d727cee7b4997a99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: See you! Good chatting with you! Have a great day!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_9-5e0dd777f616a9fdd9fee5a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:41:49.874088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e0dd777f616a9fdd9fee5a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e0dd777f616a9fdd9fee5a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
